(7344916, 1147641, 114969, '<td valign="top">Yay for nutcrackers! You made me hungry, I really need to find one of those giant peanuts. Anyway, great work, I personally don''t mind the grain at all, it quite adds to the mood. Congrats on the nice finish.</td>', 'Yay for nutcrackers! You made me hungry, I really need to find one of those giant peanuts. Anyway, great work, I personally don''t mind the grain at all, it quite adds to the mood. Congrats on the nice finish.', '2015-04-24 07:28:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7344917, 1147566, 114969, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. First of all, very fun story! Dr. Ogel (who seems to love doing things backwards) is hilarious. Your choice of colors is also very clever, and reminds one of those old comic books. Last but not least, drawing the set with just a few subtle lines permits to put the emphasis on the characters themselves: great, great idea. You really deserved a ribbon in my opinion.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. First of all, very fun story! Dr. Ogel (who seems to love doing things backwards) is hilarious. Your choice of colors is also very clever, and reminds one of those old comic books. Last but not least, drawing the set with just a few subtle lines permits to put the emphasis on the characters themselves: great, great idea. You really deserved a ribbon in my opinion.', '2015-04-24 07:32:29.000000', NULL, 0),
