(7345044, 1147660, 123833, '<td valign="top">I have read that real wolves are a problem in the French Alps attacking sheep. So, I suspect, that''s what the farmers would want to do to them! ;)<br/>Great idea but not quite a children''s story. Probably will need to wait till Emilie is at least 16 :)</td>', 'I have read that real wolves are a problem in the French Alps attacking sheep. So, I suspect, that''s what the farmers would want to do to them! ;)Great idea but not quite a children''s story. Probably will need to wait till Emilie is at least 16 :)', '2015-04-24 13:49:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7345084, 1147669, 69325, '<td valign="top">Dear Johanna,<br/> <br/>Do you ever go back and look at your first few challenge entries, then look at the more recent ones and just let it blow your mind how much you have grown? You should.<br/> <br/>Love,<br/> <br/>Jason</td>', 'Dear Johanna, Do you ever go back and look at your first few challenge entries, then look at the more recent ones and just let it blow your mind how much you have grown? You should. Love, Jason', '2015-04-24 16:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7345093, 1147641, 13891, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for your votes and comments.<br/>My first submission with the 7D MkII.<br/>I originally submitted this image without any added noise, but continued to play around with it and felt that this version with added noise had more of an industrial feel to it. Without the noise, the image felt a bit too "clean" to me. Maybe on reflection it was an erroneous decision, but these are the small changes and differences of opinion that make this hobby so interesting and challenging.<br/>gyaban - congratulations on yet another blue and thanks for taking the time to comment on mine. BTW, I finnished the whole bag of nuts in one sitting - once you start on them, there''s no stopping.<br/> <br/>DQ - I set the camera date to 2014 instead of 2015 - lesson learned!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-06-16 04:21:45.</i></td>', 'Thanks all for your votes and comments.My first submission with the 7D MkII.I originally submitted this image without any added noise, but continued to play around with it and felt that this version with added noise had more of an industrial feel to it. Without the noise, the image felt a bit too "clean" to me. Maybe on reflection it was an erroneous decision, but these are the small changes and differences of opinion that make this hobby so interesting and challenging.gyaban - congratulations on yet another blue and thanks for taking the time to comment on mine. BTW, I finnished the whole bag of nuts in one sitting - once you start on them, there''s no stopping. DQ - I set the camera date to 2014 instead of 2015 - lesson learned!', '2015-04-24 16:52:30.000000', '2015-06-16 05:21:45.000000', 0),
